WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.930
DeepSeek pushes Ascend

00:00:01.742 --> 00:00:03.805
950 kernel updates

00:00:03.982 --> 00:00:06.623
reaching 425 TFLOPS

00:00:07.158 --> 00:00:09.257
DeepSeek updated FlashMLA

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.235
DeepSelect

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:12.665
DeepGEMM and DeepGEMM-Ascend

00:00:12.476 --> 00:00:13.985
on November 26

00:00:14.163 --> 00:00:15.035
with a fused

00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:16.014
attention kernel for

00:00:15.825 --> 00:00:17.558
Huawei's Ascend 950

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.209
NPU and optimized

00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:20.483
sparse prefill and

00:00:20.472 --> 00:00:21.615
decoding kernels

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:23.458
DeepSelect gained an

00:00:23.306 --> 00:00:25.322
FP32 TopK kernel

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:25.923
for Ascend

00:00:26.065 --> 00:00:27.574
and DeepGEMM-Ascend

00:00:27.539 --> 00:00:28.376
shipped a new

00:00:28.188 --> 00:00:29.626
public release whose

00:00:29.485 --> 00:00:31.642
FP4 GEMM benchmark

00:00:31.466 --> 00:00:33.859
reaches 1,701 of

00:00:33.671 --> 00:00:36.466
1,730 TFLOPS

00:00:36.998 --> 00:00:38.236
DeepSeek has pushed

00:00:38.048 --> 00:00:39.297
updates across all

00:00:39.109 --> 00:00:39.851
four of its

00:00:39.663 --> 00:00:40.854
core infrastructure

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:41.573
repos today

00:00:41.762 --> 00:00:42.599
and most of

00:00:42.411 --> 00:00:43.153
the work is

00:00:42.965 --> 00:00:44.144
focused on making

00:00:43.956 --> 00:00:45.311
its models faster

00:00:45.123 --> 00:00:46.420
and more efficient

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:47.964
Full story on

00:00:47.775 --> 00:00:48.671
the dashboard
